name: find-root-cause-of-failures
description: Falsification-driven RCA for crashes, hangs, flaky or failing tests, builds, wrong output, performance regressions, loader identity, and merged-but-inactive fixes. It links reproduction, ranked hypotheses, decisive probes, causal repair, and validation.
