codex
The scripts expose three different bottlenecks: the X+ run fails while extending quadratic relations to cubics, the X− and isotropic runs stall in minimal-prime decomposition, and the Azure runs exhaust resources during larger syzygy or elimination computations.

The reported dimensions and degrees for X− and the isotropic case describe their quadratic relation ideals. The scripts have yet to establish that those ideals define the full fiber cones.
